WEBVTT

00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:15,810
I'm wondering if you have thoughts on moringa, benefits, concerns also regarding hormone

00:00:15,810 --> 00:00:22,530
positive breast cancer would it be okay to use moringa?

00:00:22,530 --> 00:00:31,330
Maybe, so moringa I think is a huge benefit, so most, I don't think it raises your hormone

00:00:31,330 --> 00:00:32,330
levels.

00:00:32,330 --> 00:00:36,930
I know it can be used to help balance hormones, but I don't think it's elevating estrogen

00:00:36,930 --> 00:00:39,570
or progesterone in itself.

00:00:39,570 --> 00:00:48,890
So I'm a big fan of moringa, we have that in our, I think that's in our medicinal mushroom

00:00:48,890 --> 00:00:53,650
mix that we have, but it can be a great nutritional supplement.

00:00:53,650 --> 00:00:55,650
To get that to a natural thing.

